💡 What Makes AI Interviewer Different?

AI Interviewer is more than a chatbot that asks interview questions.

It creates a complete interview preparation cycle:

Personalization → Interview → Evaluation → Analytics → Skill Gap → Learning Plan → Improvement

The AI adapts the interview based on the candidate's responses and provides actionable feedback instead of only giving a final score.

